msgstr "Cachens ålder"

#: templates/adminview.php:114
msgid ""
"Define for how long a blacklisted ip should be stored in local memory, "
"defined in seconds (minimum allowed value is 900 sec=15 minutes)"
msgstr ""
"Definiera hur länge en svartlistad ip-adress skall lagras i det lokala "
