msgstr "Ingen"

msgid "The plugin now prioritizes direct DNS lookups. Basic protection works with the public resolvers below and does not require API credentials."
msgstr "Tillägget prioriterar nu direkta DNS-uppslag. Grundskyddet fungerar med de publika resolverna nedan och kräver inga API-uppgifter."

